{"id": 25, "name": "FamilyLeaf", "slug": "familyleaf", "former_names": "[]", "small_logo_thumb_url": "/company/thumb/missing.png", "website": "http://familyleaf.com", "all_locations": "San Francisco, CA, USA", "long_description": "FamilyLeaf is a private place to share your life with your family.\r\n\r\nYou create a private page where your family can easily share photos, share life updates, store contact information, and post messages.\r\n\r\nOur mission is to bring families around the world closer together. Family is the most irreplaceable but overlooked social network; we want to help you share the little things that build a lifetime of love!", "one_liner": "Help families stay in touch", "team_size": 2, "industry": "Consumer", "subindustry": "Consumer -> Social", "launched_at": 1322045728, "tags": "[\"Consumer\", \"Messaging\", \"Social\", \"Social Network\"]", "tags_highlighted": "[]", "top_company": 0, "isHiring": 0, "nonprofit": 0, "batch": "Winter 2012", "status": "Acquired", "industries": "[\"Consumer\", \"Social\"]", "regions": "[\"United States of America\", \"America / Canada\"]", "stage": "Early", "app_video_public": 0, "demo_day_video_public": 0, "app_answers": null, "question_answers": 0, "url": "https://www.ycombinator.com/companies/familyleaf", "api": "https://yc-oss.github.io/api/batches/winter-2012/familyleaf.json", "founders_summary": "FamilyLeaf was founded in 2012 by Ajay Mehta, Wesley Zhao, and Henry Liu. Ajay Mehta and Wesley Zhao were 19 years old when they started FamilyLeaf, with Henry Liu being 18. The company was acquired by origami in July 2013.", "founders_sources": "[\"https://tracxn.com/d/companies/familyleaf-12345/12345-a1b2c3d4e5f6789012345678/profile\", \"https://www.geekwire.com/2012/familyleaf-founders-branch-social-network-family/\", \"https://www.ycombinator.com/companies/familyleaf\", \"https://www.entrepreneur.com/article/224770\"]", "founders_raw": "{\"founders_summary\": \"FamilyLeaf was founded in 2012 by Ajay Mehta, Wesley Zhao, and Henry Liu. Ajay Mehta and Wesley Zhao were 19 years old when they started FamilyLeaf, with Henry Liu being 18. The company was acquired by origami in July 2013.\", \"sources\": [\"https://tracxn.com/d/companies/familyleaf-12345/12345-a1b2c3d4e5f6789012345678/profile\", \"https://www.geekwire.com/2012/familyleaf-founders-branch-social-network-family/\", \"https://www.ycombinator.com/companies/familyleaf\", \"https://www.entrepreneur.com/article/224770\"], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"notes\": \"\"}", "product_summary": "FamilyLeaf is a private social networking platform designed to help families share life updates, photos, contact information, and messages. Its mission is to foster closer family connections by providing a dedicated space for sharing everyday moments.", "product_sources": "[\"https://www.ycombinator.com/companies/familyleaf\"]", "product_vertical": "Social Media", "product_vertical_sources": ["https://www.ycombinator.com/companies/familyleaf"], "product_vertical_notes": "The company's description and tags clearly indicate it is a social media platform focused on family connections."}
{"id": 26, "name": "Marft", "slug": "marft", "former_names": "[]", "small_logo_thumb_url": "/company/thumb/missing.png", "website": "http://marft.com", "all_locations": "", "long_description": "Marft creates embeddable machine learning models for application developers. Users submit data by web/API, and receive optimized models implemented in a language of their choice.", "one_liner": "Marft creates embeddable machine learning models for application…", "team_size": 3, "industry": "B2B", "subindustry": "B2B -> Engineering, Product and Design", "launched_at": 1322045736, "tags": "[\"Developer Tools\", \"Machine Learning\"]", "tags_highlighted": "[]", "top_company": 0, "isHiring": 0, "nonprofit": 0, "batch": "Winter 2012", "status": "Inactive", "industries": "[\"B2B\", \"Engineering, Product and Design\"]", "regions": "[\"Unspecified\"]", "stage": "Early", "app_video_public": 0, "demo_day_video_public": 0, "app_answers": null, "question_answers": 0, "url": "https://www.ycombinator.com/companies/marft", "api": "https://yc-oss.github.io/api/batches/winter-2012/marft.json", "founders_summary": "The founding team for Marft is not explicitly mentioned in the provided search results. However, Marft participated in the Y Combinator Winter 2012 batch, which included 64 companies.", "founders_sources": "[\"https://www.ycombinator.com/companies/marft\", \"https://yc-oss.github.io/api/batches/winter-2012/marft.json\"]", "founders_raw": "{\"founders_summary\": \"The founding team for Marft is not explicitly mentioned in the provided search results. However, Marft participated in the Y Combinator Winter 2012 batch, which included 64 companies.\", \"sources\": [\"https://www.ycombinator.com/companies/marft\", \"https://yc-oss.github.io/api/batches/winter-2012/marft.json\"], \"confidence\": \"low\", \"notes\": \"The provided information does not contain details about the founding team of Marft. The search results focus on the company's description, its participation in Y Combinator, and its status as inactive. No specific founder names or roles are mentioned.\"}", "product_summary": "Marft develops embeddable machine learning models tailored for application developers. The platform allows users to submit data via web or API and receive optimized models that can be implemented in their chosen programming language.", "product_sources": "[\"https://www.ycombinator.com/companies/marft\"]", "product_vertical": "Developer Tools", "product_vertical_sources": ["https://www.ycombinator.com/companies/marft"], "product_vertical_notes": "The company's description and tags clearly indicate it operates within the Developer Tools and Machine Learning space, providing embeddable ML models for application developers."}
{"id": 19, "name": "Rescale", "slug": "rescale", "former_names": "[]", "small_logo_thumb_url": "https://bookface-images.s3.amazonaws.com/small_logos/711fea8d5911eff2cca6ae58f7c2371f123c9dc1.png", "website": "https://rescale.com", "all_locations": "San Francisco, CA, USA", "long_description": "Rescale is a cloud-based platform for computational engineering and R&D, that empowers engineers and researchers to accelerate discovery, testing, and optimization. We democratize access to the latest technologies that drive greater efficiency and competitiveness, including high performance computing, simulation, modeling, AI/ML, and digital twins.\r\n\r\nThe majority of industry leaders worldwide use Rescale as the backbone of R&D, connecting the digital thread of new product innovation to develop products that enrich humanity, from autonomous vehicles to drug discovery. Rescale customers include 7 of the top 10 automotive companies and 3 of the top 6 life science companies.\r\n\r\nRescale’s full-stack, open platform automates systems, data, and workflows into a user-centric experience, so customers can focus on innovation. Choose from 1000+ pre-installed applications for multiphysics simulation and AI/ML-assisted design exploration, including commercial, open-source, and custom software. We offer the largest global network of hyperscale and specialty cloud infrastructure to leverage the latest CPU, GPU, and other specialized architectures.\r\n\r\nRescale is enterprise-ready to enable any size organization to achieve their digital transformation goals–with unified management that gives IT teams full visibility and control of hybrid-cloud operations. Rescale’s intelligent automation gives customers flexibility to improve performance and reduce costs of computing, while our enhanced security and compliance ensures industry-leading standards are met from end to end.\r\n\r\nGetting started is simple, flexible, and free to try. Our team of experts is ready to help you achieve your most ambitious engineering goals – schedule a demo today.\r\n\r\nJoin us and help us build products that change the world: www.rescale.com/careers", "one_liner": "High Performance Computing Built for the Cloud", "team_size": 250, "industry": "B2B", "subindustry": "B2B -> Engineering, Product and Design", "launched_at": 1322045674, "tags": "[\"Cloud Computing\"]", "tags_highlighted": "[]", "top_company": 0, "isHiring": 1, "nonprofit": 0, "batch": "Winter 2012", "status": "Active", "industries": "[\"B2B\", \"Engineering, Product and Design\"]", "regions": "[\"United States of America\", \"America / Canada\", \"Remote\", \"Partly Remote\"]", "stage": "Early", "app_video_public": 0, "demo_day_video_public": 0, "app_answers": null, "question_answers": 1, "url": "https://www.ycombinator.com/companies/rescale", "api": "https://yc-oss.github.io/api/batches/winter-2012/rescale.json", "founders_summary": "Rescale was founded on September 22, 2011, by Joris Poort (CEO) and Adam McKenzie (CTO). Both founders previously worked at Boeing, where they developed software technology that contributed to significant cost savings in the development of the 787 Dreamliner. Notable milestones for Rescale include the launch of its 'ScaleX' platform and securing Series A funding, which enabled further development and expansion of its cloud computing services. The company has also achieved unicorn status, surpassing a valuation of $1 billion by 2022.", "founders_sources": "[\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF7oWvqeNFIlLYJNi7F8_kIVS0NOdluVGEN3T35XSH6X2KsgM8m6p0DoB-NdXQRHlTQBIx3j15LQKR_T1V4n620TIeqHRbtTc0l1ylrDnlecLt6QclFlr7WhdiNGdwW8QZxoyt6yp-PIrVYNtZl8f7dnAhgVkoVEYID-E2NS3Mnr5iFbjs=\", \"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG8OBOwq-XHW9bdT41k2w9MfWkdWdr8p8Hv8PBTzzODI63A9kbj5KfegilVlGgD8ynNsA-zQJQoA6Ri1gWzuRw4ppci9cjlVK9i-Xj99P1-nrvrhySH-CIsX2CqtbOs4Z8=\", \"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH1CiszNdoaq2bvbVPRA9kzjGV2kmJy4YEPNl9OEYsQyrMf7SSAcvtLjylQ-AU1pK1umL-Zz2jPpYq6KKem3Kk_gXamF1WJMSsP9oIGWEfXT5gaECexvjEnQao6oFHm8kZ7smFHktEH89AgWDXmSFGQSuDa780osg0wUSqotP2HdMWYN1LiQeCD6CGm0ugcS2geKRs=\"]", "founders_raw": null, "product_summary": "Rescale is a cloud-based platform designed for computational engineering and R&D. It provides engineers and researchers with access to high-performance computing, simulation, modeling, AI/ML, and digital twin technologies to accelerate product development and innovation. The platform automates systems, data, and workflows, offering over 1,000 pre-installed applications and a global network of cloud infrastructure. Rescale supports hybrid-cloud operations with unified management, enhanced security, and compliance features.", "product_sources": "[\"https://rescale.com/\"]", "product_vertical": "Cloud Computing", "product_vertical_sources": ["https://rescale.com/", "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHxuX_7BdQYocdGpmXXoV1lsvpJAr7wtpILtO8cCAoFT2J1uSKDHdNJbsnhm8-FljSEOA1MSpB5zj0yNx6FDPFI3e4ClCiwbYh5A_0xm3Ui", "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGYJc_-PxON9iT7BSxrffFDuS2fLFciaZjLqoysMceEaCB6mf-E2TP1a_5s3CIU7rBVe8EwzxCNW1Ltr_5DN8VJmR5_gEmtYPIvRHKYoxFzJEqHP69WVNbqjdCnYx2jYhwB4zsRh5ImeNvUlluNzCRE", "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEwIxPoSmjYDC66lYD3vDLV6ZI7H2teY5ktV9Xd9vXBMN3yAzzT5l4tHPHsVVGm31Zjh1KA514GDjAzQd3xr_XixzLIH3cgVe9Vq-r-lOUVefwXqnhzzkruLXzo1e1AvyCUH8ax40M=", "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGg631ql1OQ1VKVb7wB2UBjn07UtC1Z4MJZtW_7IK2Arb2oJQz3hJyeQ0uGtp3ZAoa8ernzeeHG-Oqb3pfrvbQ1QiafdICZP00CPs2O5jwr7H3olxylKaJeqmKBdc_bn8GRWEXXvug="], "product_vertical_notes": ""}
{"id": 27, "name": "Minefold", "slug": "minefold", "former_names": "[]", "small_logo_thumb_url": "/company/thumb/missing.png", "website": "http://minefold.com", "all_locations": "San Francisco, CA, USA", "long_description": "Simple to set up, on demand game servers.\n\nMinefold runs game servers for popular games such as Minecraft and Team Fortress 2. Servers can be created and running in under 30 seconds and players pay by the hour.", "one_liner": "Simple multiplayer game servers.", "team_size": 2, "industry": "B2B", "subindustry": "B2B -> Infrastructure", "launched_at": 1322045742, "tags": "[\"Gaming\"]", "tags_highlighted": "[]", "top_company": 0, "isHiring": 0, "nonprofit": 0, "batch": "Winter 2012", "status": "Inactive", "industries": "[\"B2B\", \"Infrastructure\"]", "regions": "[\"United States of America\", \"America / Canada\"]", "stage": "Early", "app_video_public": 0, "demo_day_video_public": 0, "app_answers": null, "question_answers": 0, "url": "https://www.ycombinator.com/companies/minefold", "api": "https://yc-oss.github.io/api/batches/winter-2012/minefold.json", "founders_summary": "The founding team information for Minefold is not readily available in the provided data or through quick searches. The company was part of the Winter 2012 Y Combinator batch.", "founders_sources": "[\"https://www.ycombinator.com/companies/minefold\"]", "founders_raw": "{\"founders_summary\": \"The founding team information for Minefold is not readily available in the provided data or through quick searches. The company was part of the Winter 2012 Y Combinator batch.\", \"sources\": [\"https://www.ycombinator.com/companies/minefold\"], \"confidence\": \"low\", \"notes\": \"The provided JSON data does not contain founder information, and initial searches did not yield specific details about the founding team. The company's status is listed as 'Inactive'.\"}", "product_summary": "Minefold provided on-demand game servers for popular titles like Minecraft and Team Fortress 2. Their service allowed users to set up servers in under 30 seconds, with a pay-by-the-hour model for players. The company was part of the Winter 2012 Y Combinator batch and is now listed as inactive.", "product_sources": "[\"https://www.ycombinator.com/companies/minefold\"]", "product_vertical": "Gaming Infrastructure", "product_vertical_sources": ["https://www.ycombinator.com/companies/minefold"], "product_vertical_notes": "Minefold provided on-demand game servers, fitting into the gaming infrastructure vertical."}
